{
    "title": "Texture Maker for Minecraft PE",
    "description": "Texture Maker for Minecraft PE: Unleash Your Creativity with highlight function: CREATE, EDIT AND INSTALL NEW TEXTURE PACKS.\r\n\r\nPrepare for a new gameplay with Texture Maker for Minecraft PE! This all-in-one toolkit empowers you to transform your Minecraft world like never before.\r\n\r\n\u2705 Create Your Own Masterpieces:\r\n- Design custom texture packs from scratch, editing everything from blocks to UI and even sky, water,...\r\n- Access a vast library of 1000+ texture pack ideas to inspire your creations.\r\n- Share your unique designs with the Minecraft community like Actions and Stuffs, Realism, Survival texture, gun 3d, sword 3D, RTX pack, PvP pack,...\r\n\r\n\u2705 Effortless Texture Editing:\r\n- Quickly install unlimited resource packs and shaders for Minecraft 1.21+.\r\n- Extract mcpack files to edit shaders, PvP packs, and more.\r\n- Utilize the Pixel Art Editor to fine-tune your textures with precision.\r\n\r\n\u2705 Become a Minecraft Modding Master:\r\n- Create Minecraft texture paths with ease.\r\n- Edit JSON Editor like master texture creator\r\n- Craft stunning PvP texture packs in a few simple steps.\r\n- Add new resource packs for MCPE 1.21+ and extract them for editing.\r\n- Export your creations to Minecraft Pocket Edition and other popular Minecraft platforms.\r\n\r\n\u2705 Discover a World of Textures:\r\n- Explore an exclusive collection of Minecraft texture packs, including:\r\n    - Actions and Stuff resource pack\r\n    - Black texture pack\r\n    - Dark UI, GUI\r\n    - 16x Pvp texture pack\r\n    - Ultra realistic shaders for MCPE\r\n    - Vanilla+ Minecraft shader texture packs\r\n    - 256x RTX Pack, 32x, 128x,...\r\n\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Official Disclaimer:\r\nThis is an unofficial application for Minecraft. This Minecraft texture pack maker application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand, and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines\r\n\r\n<b>Texture Maker for Minecraft PE</b> is an application created by PA Mobile Studio. If you have problems or have an idea to develop our app, contact us by email: contact@pamobile.co",
    "descriptionHTML": "Texture Maker for Minecraft PE: Unleash Your Creativity with highlight function: CREATE, EDIT AND INSTALL NEW TEXTURE PACKS.<br><br>Prepare for a new gameplay with Texture Maker for Minecraft PE! This all-in-one toolkit empowers you to transform your Minecraft world like never before.<br><br>\u2705 Create Your Own Masterpieces:<br>- Design custom texture packs from scratch, editing everything from blocks to UI and even sky, water,...<br>- Access a vast library of 1000+ texture pack ideas to inspire your creations.<br>- Share your unique designs with the Minecraft community like Actions and Stuffs, Realism, Survival texture, gun 3d, sword 3D, RTX pack, PvP pack,...<br><br>\u2705 Effortless Texture Editing:<br>- Quickly install unlimited resource packs and shaders for Minecraft 1.21+.<br>- Extract mcpack files to edit shaders, PvP packs, and more.<br>- Utilize the Pixel Art Editor to fine-tune your textures with precision.<br><br>\u2705 Become a Minecraft Modding Master:<br>- Create Minecraft texture paths with ease.<br>- Edit JSON Editor like master texture creator<br>- Craft stunning PvP texture packs in a few simple steps.<br>- Add new resource packs for MCPE 1.21+ and extract them for editing.<br>- Export your creations to Minecraft Pocket Edition and other popular Minecraft platforms.<br><br>\u2705 Discover a World of Textures:<br>- Explore an exclusive collection of Minecraft texture packs, including:<br>    - Actions and Stuff resource pack<br>    - Black texture pack<br>    - Dark UI, GUI<br>    - 16x Pvp texture pack<br>    - Ultra realistic shaders for MCPE<br>    - Vanilla+ Minecraft shader texture packs<br>    - 256x RTX Pack, 32x, 128x,...<br><br>\u270d\ufe0f Official Disclaimer:<br>This is an unofficial application for Minecraft. This Minecraft texture pack maker application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand, and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines<br><br><b>Texture Maker for Minecraft PE</b> is an application created by PA Mobile Studio. If you have problems or have an idea to develop our app, contact us by email: contact@pamobile.co",
